!This is a dummy input file for Flaps2D

M 11
N 11

TimeStep 1.0e-18
TimeMax 0.0e-15
Text 80.0
RestartCalc 0
DumpInterval 10000 !Interval for writing the restart

OutputIter 1000

! Laser
Fluence 10.0e0
Wavelength 515.0e-9
PulseFWHM 40.0e-15

PolarizationSource 0
phiMie0 270.0
UseMieScattering 1 !-1: constant intensity, 0: some fittings, 1: Mie scattering.

! Model
DrudeHeating 1
TransportModel -1 
ConvectionEnergy 0

!Debug options
NeOff 0
TeOff 0
HolesOff 0
TsOff 0
ImpactOff 0
CrossDiffusionOff 0
